SUMMARY:Heart of the City Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Serving San Francisco’s Civic Center and surrounding neighborhoods since 1981\, this independent\, farmer-operated\, non-profit market operates daily on Wednesdays and Sundays year round (rain or shine!) with a mission to bring high-quality and affordable produce from small local farms to the heart of San Francisco. This well-loved market\, just steps from City Hall\, offers a variety of lunch options and seating on Wednesdays. \nDon’t miss the market’s 45th birthday celebration on Sunday\, June 14th! \nSundays and Wednesdays\, 7am-4pm; more info here.
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/heart-of-the-city-farmers-market/
CATEGORIES:Farmers Market,Shopping
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sfciviccenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/HOTCFulton.png
END:VEVENT
