SUMMARY:Civic Center Soundtrack Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:Returning April 14th\, Civic Center Soundtrack\, a free concert series by Illuminate\, takes place at Fulton Plaza between San Francisco Main Library and the Asian Art Museum. \nThe diverse musical performances will be held every Tuesday and Thursdays from noon to 3 pm\, bring your lunch or grab a bite at the food truck. The full lineup can be found here; be sure to stop by for a free concert in San Francisco’s premier arts and culture district! Concert series runs through October.
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/civic-center-soundtrack-concert-series/
CATEGORIES:Community,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sfciviccenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Screen-Shot-2026-04-06-at-10.19.49-AM.png
END:VEVENT
