SUMMARY:Asian Art Museum Free First Sundays
DESCRIPTION:The Asian Art Museum welcomes visitors to explore the general exhibits of the museum for free every first Sunday of the month. It’s best to reserve your free ticket and admission time via their site. First Sunday of the month\, free; 10am-5pm. \nAlso during museum hours\, all are welcome to visit the Asian Art Museum’s store\, the Cha May Ching Museum Boutique\, and restaurant\,  Asian Box\, without paid admission. 
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/asian-art-museum-free-first-sundays/2026-07-05/
LOCATION:Asian Art Museum\, 200 Larkin St.\, San Francisco\, 94102\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Community,Kids and Families
