SUMMARY:UN Plaza Fitness Classes: Dance\, Cardio & More
DESCRIPTION:Get moving at the fitness classes led by Rae Studios in UN Plaza! From jazz funk to salsa\, and K-Pop to hip hop\, there’s something for everyone. All ages\, all levels of dance\, all abilities welcome! \nClasses do require an RSVP; sign up for the daily fitness classes led by Rae Studios here.  \nPlease see the sign up link for any changes/weather related cancelations\, etc. \n \n  \nSupport from: \n 
