SUMMARY:Learn and Play Chess and Mahjong at UN Plaza
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn chess and mahjong\, or sharpen the skills you already have? Check out the chess and mahjong event series taking place at UN Plaza every Friday\, 2-5pm! \nFeaturing drop-in games and free lessons from the Mechanics’ Institute\, the weekly event also features chess-puzzles and other games such as dominos. Free\, drop-in. \n \n \n  \nThank you to sponsors:
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/learn-and-play-chess-at-un-plaza/
