SUMMARY:Shred N' Butter: Free Skateboarding Lessons
DESCRIPTION:Want to master your kick flip? Learn how to do an ollie? Join SF Rec & Park for Shred N’ Butter every Tuesday\, 4-7pm\, at the UN Skate Plaza for free skateboarding lessons! No RSVP required. Boards and equipment are available to borrow during class.
