DESCRIPTION:The Friends of the San Francisco Public Library Step Sales have returned! Every Wednesday\, visit the Larkin Street steps of the Main Branch of the SF Public Library to find used books of all sorts! Happens every Wednesday\, unless rain\, 11am-3pm.
