SUMMARY:Keepin' It Safe in the City
DESCRIPTION:Happening at Civic Center Plaza\, the 3rd annual Keepin’ It Safe in the City features fire trucks\, a bounce house\, music and food. Attendees will also meet first responders\, take part in fun activities and win raffle prizes. \nSponsored by: The San Francisco District Attorney’s Office \nMore information here.  \nAlso be sure the check out the adjacent Fall Family Festival and Market Street Arts & Theater Festival.
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/keepin-it-safe-in-the-city/
CATEGORIES:Community,Kids and Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sfciviccenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-28-at-12.50.08 PM.png
END:VEVENT
