SUMMARY:Market Street Arts & Theater Festival
DESCRIPTION:Taking place at location in Mid Market and Civic Center\, on October 17th\, the Market Street Arts & Theater Festival\, 4-10pm\, will feature of an evening of entertainment. In Civic Center\, UN Plaza will host circus and aerial dance performances by: \nDear San Francisco\nCircus Bella\nSpectrum Theater\nThe Peoples Circus\nBandaloop Vertical Dancers\nACT’S Young Conservatory Cabaret \n\nAt Civic Center Plaza don’t miss Dueling Pianos. Also stop by Limoncello for drinks and bites. \n\n\nMore about their full event here. \n\n\nAlso check out adjacent kid and family friendly events: Fall Family Festival in Fulton Plaza\, 4-7pm & Keepin’ It Safe the City in Civic Center Plaza\, 10am-2pm. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n 
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/market-street-arts-theater-festival/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sfciviccenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-01-at-12.32.02 PM.png
