SUMMARY:City Arts & Lectures at the Sydney Goldstein Theater
DESCRIPTION:“Each year there are more than fifty lectures and onstage conversations – and a few surprise performances\, film tributes\, and concerts – with outstanding writers\, critics\, scientists\, performing artists\, and cultural figures from around the world\,” as part of City Arts & Lectures at the Sydney Goldstein Theater (formerly the Nourse). \nUpcoming speakers for fall 2026 include David Byrne (Oct 11)\, Zadie Smith in conversation with Sam Fragoso (Oct 14)\,  Barbara Kingsolver in conversation with Steven Winn (Oct 23) and many more. \nSee the City Arts & Lectures site for a full calendar and link to tickets. \n 
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/city-arts-lectures-at-the-sydney-goldstein-theater/
