DESCRIPTION:Destress\, stretch\, and learn some new yoga poses at the free yoga classes hosted by SF Rec & Park at UN Plaza. \nThese free\, drop-in classes are all ages\, all levels. \nMondays\, noon-1pm \nTuesdays\, noon-1pm \nThursdays\, 1-2pm \nPlease note that rain may lead to the cancellation of classes and Wednesday classes have been discontinued. \n \n 
