SUMMARY:Zumba in Civic Center
DESCRIPTION:Zumba instructor Matt Ziegler leads classes in Civic Center Plaza (weather permitting) on Sundays (10-11am)\, Wednesdays (noon-1pm) and Fridays (noon-1pm) with SF Rec & Parks Zumba in the Parks. The class is for all ages and skill levels; meet on the paved portion of the plaza adjacent to City Hall. Free\, drop-in. \nSee the schedule here. 
