SUMMARY:Asian Art Museum's Mahjong and Mocktails Thursdays
DESCRIPTION:Every Thursday from 5 to 8pm\, the Asian Art Museum host a fun night of mahjong and mocktails. Whether a newbie\, or an experienced player\, game play is open to all ages and is included with the price of museum admission. \nMocktails available for purchase. The museum provides free tiles for game play.
