SUMMARY:Moving San Francisco: SFMTA Photos 1903-Now
DESCRIPTION:Moving San Francisco: Views from the SFMTA Photo Archive 1903 – Now at City Hall features\, “an exhibition that celebrates the history of Muni and the evolution of our city with a collection of images from the SFMTA Photo Archive.” From the Francisco Arts Commission (SFAC)\, in partnership with the San Francisco Municipal Transportation Agency’s (SFMTA) Photo Archive\, Moving San Francisco will be on display on the Ground Floor and North Light Court at City Hall through November 25\, 2026. \n 
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/moving-san-francisco-sfmta-photos-1903-now/
