SUMMARY:Holiday Season Performing Arts Showcase
DESCRIPTION:On Friday\, November 13\, from 5–7 p.m.\, Fulton Plaza will come alive beneath the dazzling Spectra lights for the Holiday Season Performing Arts Showcase\, a celebration bringing together some of downtown’s most exciting performing arts organizations for one unforgettable evening. \nGuests will be treated to a dynamic lineup of live performances of what’s on stage this season. Expect short works from the San Francisco Opera\, San Francisco Ballet\, the African American Shakespeare Company\, the San Francisco Philharmonic and RAW Dance\, and more. From powerful voices and sweeping orchestral music to captivating movement and theatrical performances\, the showcase offers a little bit of everything — and is a memorable way to launch the holiday season.  \nThis event is free\, and no ticket required to attend. \nAlso be sure to visit the adjacent food trucks and bar\, and visit with the arts organizations to learn more about what they’re bringing to the stage Fall 2026-Winter 2027.
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/holiday-season-performing-arts-showcase/
CATEGORIES:Art,Community,Dance,Music,Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sfciviccenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-06-at-9.44.46 AM.png
END:VEVENT
