SUMMARY:Civic Center Plaza Tree Lighting 2026
DESCRIPTION:Save the date! The annual Civic Center Plaza Tree Lighting is taking place across the street from an illuminated City Hall on Wednesday\, December 2nd\, 4-7pm! Featuring a night of festive entertainment\, a toy giveaway for the first 500 children\, “snow” flurries\, holiday beverages and bites for purchase and more. Also the night wouldn’t be complete without a visit from the VIP-of-the-hour: Santa! \nMore information to come.
