SUMMARY:"Get Rolling" All Ages Open Skate
DESCRIPTION:Grab your roller skates or blades from home for a few fun laps on the smooth surface of Fulton Plaza. Whether you’re practicing moves for your roller derby league\, popping in your earbuds to get some cardio in\, or just practicing some new skate moves\, it’a fun\, free and safe place to roll! If you’re lucky\, there just may be a local DJ spinning some tunes to skate to as well!  \n  \n \n  \n 
