SUMMARY:Speak Low Tango Club on Saturdays and Milonga La Paz on Sundays
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Golden Age Tango Academy (GATA)\, Speak Low Tango Club on Saturdays and the Sunday Milonga La Paz are participatory dance events for seniors and veterans. \nSpeak Low Tango Club features an all levels class with instructors Ivan and Ivy from 3-4pm followed by a Milonga Party from 4-7pm with DJ Ivan spinning traditional\, danceable Argentine tunes for social dancing; no partner required\, all skill levels welcomed\, masks and vaccination required; $20. \nThe Milonga La Paz event on Sunday evenings\, 6-10pm\, features DJ Ivan spinning traditional\, danceable Argentine tunes for dancers of all skill levels; $15. \nMore info on the Golden Age Tango Academy site; Veterans Building\, 401 Van Ness Ave\, Room 412.
URL:https://sfciviccenter.org/event/speak-low-tango-club-on-saturdays-and-milonga-la-paz-on-sundays/
